WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 14=

02:01.740 --> 02:02.300
You're back.

02:03.000 --> 02:04.377
Still not asleep this late?

02:04.380 --> 02:05.260
I was waiting for you.

02:05.260 --> 02:06.460
I knew you'd come back.

02:08.800 --> 02:09.822
You're still up, too?

02:10.700 --> 02:11.260
I'm hungry.

02:16.555 --> 02:18.580
So, when did you
and Zhang Yousen get together?

02:19.380 --> 02:20.180
Before dinner today.

02:21.140 --> 02:21.900
Why?

02:23.733 --> 02:25.340
I just wanted to bring a boyfriend

02:25.340 --> 02:26.355
to dinner with you all.

02:28.088 --> 02:29.380
What kind of reason is that?

02:31.340 --> 02:32.580
So now dinner's over,

02:32.755 --> 02:34.155
and you've already broken up?

02:34.244 --> 02:35.155
We didn't break up.

02:35.380 --> 02:36.020
So now

02:36.380 --> 02:37.380
you're officially dating?

02:38.533 --> 02:40.044
What do you like about him?

02:41.700 --> 02:43.420
I like

02:44.420 --> 02:45.100
that he likes me.

02:46.333 --> 02:48.111
He's picking me up for work tomorrow.

02:49.060 --> 02:50.340
Just don't hurt him.

02:51.955 --> 02:53.540
You're my friend, or he's your friend?

02:53.860 --> 02:55.220
Exactly because you're my friend,

02:56.100 --> 02:57.380
I'm worried about him.

03:02.100 --> 03:02.580
Zhou Mei,

03:02.777 --> 03:03.500
congratulations.

03:03.555 --> 03:05.733
You're the first among us
to get into a relationship.

03:06.200 --> 03:07.066
What about you?

03:07.822 --> 03:08.940
Those male classmates of yours,

03:08.940 --> 03:10.133
not a single one you like?

03:10.420 --> 03:11.780
I don't like my male classmates.

03:12.177 --> 03:13.355
They're too immature.

03:14.940 --> 03:16.180
I like someone like Mr. He Han.

03:17.140 --> 03:18.500
I mean his type.

03:19.422 --> 03:20.711
What do you like about him?

03:21.300 --> 03:21.740
His talent.

03:22.977 --> 03:25.555
I've never thought there
was anything special about him.

03:26.660 --> 03:28.620
If his writing is good, just read it.

03:28.740 --> 03:30.066
Why bother looking at the person?

03:30.180 --> 03:30.820
If one day

03:30.820 --> 03:32.500
you found his talent was gone,

03:32.820 --> 03:33.980
would you still like him?

03:35.020 --> 03:36.780
Talent is innate.

03:36.780 --> 03:38.200
How could it just disappear?

03:38.500 --> 03:39.620
Talent and looks

03:39.980 --> 03:41.700
can both change over time.

03:53.500 --> 03:53.860
Alright.

03:54.540 --> 03:55.020
I'm sleepy.

03:55.933 --> 03:56.800
I'll go to sleep.

03:58.460 --> 03:59.340
Good night.

04:57.500 --> 04:57.900
Hello?

04:58.260 --> 04:59.380
What are you doing?

05:00.340 --> 05:02.300
Do you realize how childish this is?

05:09.420 --> 05:10.940
I didn't know what else to do.

05:13.940 --> 05:15.300
Just when I went out,

05:15.300 --> 05:16.820
Zhang Yousen texted me,

05:17.660 --> 05:18.740
asking me to dinner.

05:19.340 --> 05:20.260
So I let him come.

05:21.140 --> 05:21.660
I said

05:22.620 --> 05:23.740
I wanted him to come

05:23.740 --> 05:24.980
as my boyfriend.

05:29.340 --> 05:31.820
I couldn't face that dinner alone.

05:33.700 --> 05:34.660
I would've lost it.

05:36.060 --> 05:38.540
But if you keep getting
entangled with Lawyer Bei like this,

05:39.133 --> 05:40.940
sooner or later
Zhang Yousen will find out

05:40.940 --> 05:41.860
you're using him.

05:42.266 --> 05:44.488
And when that happens,
he'll be the one losing it.

05:44.955 --> 05:47.266
I won't have anything
to do with Lawyer Bei anymore.

05:49.340 --> 05:49.980
And I won't

05:51.420 --> 05:52.500
hurt Zhang Yousen either.

05:54.500 --> 05:55.460
He's a good person.

05:56.260 --> 05:57.180
Better than Lawyer Bei.

05:59.580 --> 06:00.020
So...

06:01.340 --> 06:02.620
I'll keep seeing him,

06:04.300 --> 06:05.580
even if it's just for a while.

06:06.340 --> 06:07.500
I'll still do my best.

06:09.460 --> 06:10.460
Then remember this.

06:11.140 --> 06:12.940
You've already added Mrs. Bei on WeChat.

06:13.540 --> 06:14.460
So, what you post

06:14.780 --> 06:15.580
and what you don't,

06:16.100 --> 06:17.220
you have to be very careful.

06:19.780 --> 06:21.700
I think Mrs. Bei already knows.

06:23.300 --> 06:24.820
Otherwise, she wouldn't have added us.

06:26.333 --> 06:28.020
Don't underestimate a woman's intuition.

06:30.940 --> 06:31.460
But now

06:33.660 --> 06:35.140
I have a boyfriend.

06:36.340 --> 06:38.260
The pressure now is on Lawyer Bei.

07:26.620 --> 07:27.060
Zhanqiao,

07:28.422 --> 07:30.177
let's grab some breakfast together.

07:31.500 --> 07:31.860
Sure.

07:32.100 --> 07:32.666
Let's go.

07:33.460 --> 07:34.140
You already ate?

07:34.860 --> 07:35.340
Yeah.

07:40.660 --> 07:42.380
I messaged you,
and you replied so slowly.

07:44.060 --> 07:45.060
You must've been busy.

07:48.860 --> 07:50.100
Yeah, busy saving my company.

07:50.620 --> 07:51.500
You know how it is.

07:51.820 --> 07:52.660
You're joking.

07:53.940 --> 07:54.700
So many people

07:55.444 --> 07:56.711
are trying to save you.

07:57.660 --> 07:58.540
You're just choosing

07:58.940 --> 08:00.700
who gets that chance,

08:01.100 --> 08:01.500
right?

08:02.500 --> 08:03.540
I'm in line, too.

08:06.780 --> 08:08.100
Let me be honest, Mr. Fan.

08:09.780 --> 08:11.460
I do want to partner with you,

08:12.380 --> 08:13.133
but the price

08:14.020 --> 08:14.940
you offered

08:15.100 --> 08:16.100
is far too low.

08:16.740 --> 08:18.260
Other investors, although...

08:18.260 --> 08:19.555
Things are different now.

08:19.700 --> 08:20.660
I can offer more.

08:21.460 --> 08:22.100
No upper limit.

08:23.644 --> 08:25.100
I'll bring you the contract later.

08:28.044 --> 08:30.377
That doesn't sound
like something you'd say.

08:32.300 --> 08:33.620
You're being unfair.

08:34.220 --> 08:35.340
Why didn't you tell me

08:35.844 --> 08:37.244
that He Han is coming back?

08:42.444 --> 08:43.340
You kept it from me.

08:46.100 --> 08:47.220
Otherwise, how could

08:47.220 --> 08:49.266
so many people come
looking to invest in you?

08:49.580 --> 08:50.700
If you'd told me earlier,

08:50.700 --> 08:51.980
what chance would they have had?

08:56.700 --> 08:58.180
I don't know where you heard that,

08:58.780 --> 09:00.420
but rumors are just rumors.

09:00.420 --> 09:01.340
What rumors?

09:01.460 --> 09:02.700
He Han said it himself.

09:02.955 --> 09:04.460
And you're still keeping it secret?

09:23.060 --> 09:24.220
Mr. Fan just told me

09:24.940 --> 09:25.860
you admitted to him

09:25.977 --> 09:27.577
that you agreed to return to Chenxing.

09:27.780 --> 09:28.460
Is that true?

09:29.155 --> 09:30.260
Why don't I know about it?

09:30.666 --> 09:32.420
Your best friend
asked me to do you a favor,

09:32.500 --> 09:33.460
saying it would be easy

09:33.460 --> 09:35.100
and could get you out of trouble.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.940
It's hard to explain over the phone.

09:54.940 --> 09:56.340
Tell me what's going on.

09:57.820 --> 09:58.660
Something this big,

09:58.660 --> 09:59.980
and you didn't tell me in advance.

10:00.260 --> 10:01.540
When Mr. Fan asked me just now,

10:01.900 --> 10:02.940
I didn't dare say a word.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.660
I was afraid that if I
said the wrong thing,

10:04.660 --> 10:05.620
the money would be gone.

10:06.020 --> 10:07.580
Before, so many investment firms

10:07.580 --> 10:08.977
were interested in working with you.

10:09.020 --> 10:10.220
Some of them are my friends,

10:10.500 --> 10:12.380
and the rest I drew in
by spreading the word

10:12.866 --> 10:14.511
that He Han was returning to Chenxing.

10:15.220 --> 10:17.100
Now is the best time
to invest at a low price.

10:17.820 --> 10:19.500
But you know that's impossible.

10:19.500 --> 10:21.066
Doesn't matter whether it's possible.

10:21.460 --> 10:23.260
Those companies are
just here to prop you up.

10:23.866 --> 10:25.420
As long as the show looks convincing

10:25.488 --> 10:27.511
and draws Mr. Fan's attention,
that's enough.

10:27.666 --> 10:29.222
When Mr. Fan came to see you today,

10:29.380 --> 10:31.420
he must have heard about it from them.

10:32.888 --> 10:34.088
What about He Han?

10:35.340 --> 10:36.180
If Mr. Fan asked him,

10:36.580 --> 10:37.460
why did he admit it?

10:38.780 --> 10:40.540
Of course, I had to give him a heads-up.

10:42.420 --> 10:43.020
Here.

10:43.711 --> 10:44.622
- Thanks.
- Nuts.

10:46.460 --> 10:46.860
He Han,

10:47.860 --> 10:49.220
is this your new girlfriend?

10:49.820 --> 10:50.300
No.

10:51.400 --> 10:53.250
I don't think you
could win her over anyway.

10:53.250 --> 10:54.666
We're not interested in each other.

10:54.740 --> 10:55.580
Genetic mismatch.

10:55.700 --> 10:56.940
Boss, check please.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.500
Coming. You guys carry on.

10:58.700 --> 10:59.540
Coming.

11:01.180 --> 11:03.140
Anyone with eyes can see

11:03.222 --> 11:05.733
that you and Lin Zhanqiao
still care about each other.

11:06.180 --> 11:07.020
So you'll definitely

11:07.200 --> 11:08.180
help with this, right?

11:09.888 --> 11:11.580
Lin Zhanqiao asked you to come find me?

11:12.977 --> 11:13.860
I haven't told her yet.

11:15.140 --> 11:16.955
We'll act it out first,
and then tell her.

11:17.820 --> 11:18.860
Otherwise,

11:18.977 --> 11:20.644
she'll make a big deal out of it again.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.980
You came up with this plan

11:24.700 --> 11:26.380
because she mentioned wanting me back?

11:28.820 --> 11:29.380
Well, no.

11:31.420 --> 11:32.020
Good.

11:33.220 --> 11:35.060
Anyway, the script is already set.

11:36.100 --> 11:38.100
Now it's up to you and He Han

11:38.420 --> 11:40.500
to figure out how to
play this reconciliation.

11:41.780 --> 11:43.660
Mr. Fan sees Chenxing's future value.

11:44.540 --> 11:46.260
If he invests heavily
and signs with you,

11:46.580 --> 11:47.580
then you've succeeded.

11:48.140 --> 11:49.580
He's too shrewd.

11:50.100 --> 11:51.220
How could he fall for this

11:51.220 --> 11:52.220
so easily?

11:52.333 --> 11:53.711
He's taking a gamble, too.

11:54.355 --> 11:55.933
If He Han really returns to Chenxing,

11:56.020 --> 11:56.860
on paper,

11:56.955 --> 11:58.777
then he'll have to invest even more.

11:58.866 --> 12:00.000
So, you need to make him

12:00.266 --> 12:02.888
feel his chances of winning
are higher, and then he will be

12:03.060 --> 12:04.022
willing to put in money.

12:04.060 --> 12:05.300
What if he just drags it out?

12:06.220 --> 12:07.740
My company can't afford to wait.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.460
Then, it becomes a game between you two.

12:11.100 --> 12:12.300
Given his personality,

12:14.260 --> 12:15.380
you should

12:15.511 --> 12:17.488
deny that you
and He Han have reconciled.

12:17.900 --> 12:18.820
The more you deny it,

12:18.866 --> 12:20.288
the more interested he'll be.

12:22.700 --> 12:22.980
How...

12:23.540 --> 12:25.540
How am I supposed to say that

12:25.540 --> 12:26.140
to He Han?

12:26.260 --> 12:27.020
Come on.

12:27.660 --> 12:29.140
Your company is on the brink.

12:29.311 --> 12:31.220
What's wrong with
swallowing a bit of pride?

12:33.940 --> 12:34.420
Ms. Mei,

12:35.020 --> 12:36.420
a package from Lawyer Bei's firm.

12:39.580 --> 12:40.020
Candice.

12:43.311 --> 12:44.140
Return it to him.

12:44.700 --> 12:45.060
Alright.

12:46.380 --> 12:47.266
What did he send you?

12:49.060 --> 12:51.333
Probably tickets for
this weekend's performance.

12:52.860 --> 12:53.911
What does that mean?

12:54.580 --> 12:55.460
Trying to make amends?

12:56.380 --> 12:57.380
Ruined one evening,

12:57.380 --> 12:59.100
so he offers another to make up for it?

13:00.620 --> 13:01.420
That's probably

13:01.420 --> 13:02.780
how he sees things.

13:03.555 --> 13:05.020
I can also refuse the settlement.

13:06.060 --> 13:08.340
(Return Slip)

13:13.780 --> 13:19.580
(International Top-Tier
Music Performance)

13:30.244 --> 13:32.777
A friend gave me two tickets
for a concert this weekend.

13:33.220 --> 13:34.355
I don't have time to go.

13:34.740 --> 13:35.300
Take them.

13:35.980 --> 13:37.220
You can go with your girlfriend.

13:38.220 --> 13:38.700
Lawyer Bei,

13:39.288 --> 13:41.460
this is a show Zhou Mei
has always wanted to see.

13:41.460 --> 13:42.577
I couldn't even get tickets.

13:42.700 --> 13:43.260
Thank you.

13:45.340 --> 13:46.500
Zhou Mei will be very happy.

13:50.311 --> 13:52.060
The channel has been approved.
No problem.

13:52.980 --> 13:53.780
Hello, Mr. He Han.

13:54.500 --> 13:54.900
Alright.

13:55.100 --> 13:55.860
Don't worry.

13:55.860 --> 13:57.780
(Fresh Meat Mooncakes)

13:57.780 --> 13:58.650
Hello.

13:58.650 --> 13:59.140
Mr. He Han.

14:01.420 --> 14:02.020
Mr. He Han.

14:03.500 --> 14:04.300
Mr. He Han.

14:04.310 --> 14:05.090
Your boss is inside?

14:05.100 --> 14:05.660
Upstairs.

14:06.800 --> 14:08.260
These are the newly screened authors.

14:08.311 --> 14:09.650
There are many strong candidates.

14:09.977 --> 14:10.900
How's the progress?

14:11.060 --> 14:12.420
Fresh meat mooncakes?

14:12.660 --> 14:14.700
You can wait for
hours and still not get them.

14:14.700 --> 14:15.700
Our boss likes them.

14:16.066 --> 14:17.980
If this isn't trying to please her,
what is?

14:18.100 --> 14:18.980
What's this?

14:19.540 --> 14:22.266
Looks like it's not just
work easing the tension.

14:22.488 --> 14:23.500
They can't stay apart.

14:23.500 --> 14:24.580
The more they fight,
the harder it is to split.

14:24.580 --> 14:25.220
Impossible.

14:26.980 --> 14:27.940
Hello.

14:28.780 --> 14:29.860
- Mr. He Han.
- Mr. He Han.

14:30.100 --> 14:30.620
Mr. He.

14:30.933 --> 14:31.940
We'll get back to work.

14:45.340 --> 14:46.740
I got you the fresh meat mooncakes.

14:47.340 --> 14:48.700
Now the baton is in your hands.

14:48.700 --> 14:50.100
How do you plan to respond?

14:53.420 --> 14:54.420
If we're acting,

14:55.780 --> 14:57.660
there needs to be a gradual build-up.

14:58.133 --> 14:59.533
You can't jump straight into

14:59.940 --> 15:02.060
a dramatic reconciliation like this.

15:03.300 --> 15:04.140
Who would believe it?

15:12.900 --> 15:14.260
How much is Mr. Fan offering now?

15:27.420 --> 15:28.300
Eat it,

15:28.660 --> 15:29.911
and he can go up to seven.

15:31.340 --> 15:32.340
I've already eaten.

15:32.377 --> 15:33.466
I can't eat anymore.

15:36.020 --> 15:37.020
For Chenxing, you know?

15:56.220 --> 15:57.177
It's good, right?

15:58.780 --> 16:00.111
So this counts as helping me?

16:01.540 --> 16:02.460
Doesn't it?

16:03.740 --> 16:04.860
How should I thank you?

16:06.155 --> 16:07.466
Wait until it's done.

16:07.644 --> 16:09.466
Don't worry.
I won't take advantage of you.

16:31.780 --> 16:32.420
Thank you.

16:44.500 --> 16:45.420
Keep it up.

16:55.740 --> 16:57.580
Just follow what I told you.

16:57.740 --> 16:59.420
Right. If there are any issues...

17:00.900 --> 17:01.660
I'm leaving.

17:01.733 --> 17:03.466
There are mooncakes upstairs.
Help yourselves.

17:03.488 --> 17:04.140
- Bye.
- Alright.

17:04.140 --> 17:04.540
Thanks.

17:04.540 --> 17:05.280
- Bye.
- Thanks.

17:07.500 --> 17:08.170
I told you so.

17:08.170 --> 17:08.620
See?

17:08.620 --> 17:09.460
Fresh meat mooncakes.

17:09.580 --> 17:11.140
I only have one question now.

17:42.140 --> 17:46.660
(Editor Fan Shu, Content Department)

17:48.380 --> 17:49.460
I heard He Han

17:49.820 --> 17:52.540
bought Lin Zhanqiao
fresh meat mooncakes.

17:53.820 --> 17:55.380
Those are hard to get.

17:55.380 --> 17:57.620
You have to queue for them.

17:58.333 --> 17:59.660
Have they gotten back together?

18:00.380 --> 18:02.500
Did you notice anything?

18:03.420 --> 18:04.260
I'm not sure.

18:05.740 --> 18:07.900
Don't you think this
is a bit too sudden?

18:11.140 --> 18:12.300
Could they be

18:13.260 --> 18:14.660
putting on a show for everyone?

18:15.460 --> 18:16.540
So people would think

18:16.940 --> 18:18.900
He Han wants to return to Chenxing

18:20.220 --> 18:21.500
and rush to place their bets?

18:21.820 --> 18:23.380
Is that possible?

18:23.540 --> 18:24.700
If they've teamed up,

18:24.700 --> 18:25.740
then you picked right.

18:26.020 --> 18:28.620
I just signed He Han. If they team up,

18:28.940 --> 18:29.980
I'll be out of the game.

18:30.460 --> 18:31.610
So on this matter,

18:31.610 --> 18:32.380
we're not aligned.

18:33.020 --> 18:34.060
If you can

18:34.820 --> 18:36.740
bring Lin Zhanqiao
and He Han over to me,

18:38.180 --> 18:38.900
how about

18:39.155 --> 18:40.711
shares in Dingqi Platform?

18:41.100 --> 18:42.460
You lost He Han,

18:42.980 --> 18:45.020
but you gain Dingqi Platform.

18:45.020 --> 18:45.500
How much?

18:46.933 --> 18:48.340
Ten ten-thousandths, how about it?

18:48.420 --> 18:49.488
Twenty ten-thousandths.

18:50.740 --> 18:51.100
Alright.

18:51.900 --> 18:52.580
No less than

18:53.022 --> 18:54.140
fifteen ten-thousandths.

18:54.940 --> 18:55.380
Deal.

19:02.940 --> 19:03.580
You're back.

19:04.580 --> 19:05.260
Come sit.

19:05.420 --> 19:07.044
There's something I need to tell you.

19:13.060 --> 19:13.340
Sit.

19:17.340 --> 19:19.220
How come I didn't know

19:19.220 --> 19:21.420
you were going back to Chenxing

19:21.911 --> 19:23.610
and getting back
together with Lin Zhanqiao?

19:24.300 --> 19:25.220
How could you not know?

19:25.580 --> 19:27.180
If Mr. Fan knows, then you should know.

19:27.540 --> 19:28.140
Is it true?

19:29.900 --> 19:30.580
No.

19:31.340 --> 19:33.170
I have a cooperation agreement with you.

19:33.170 --> 19:34.460
I'm not about to break it

19:34.460 --> 19:35.700
and go back to Lin Zhanqiao.

19:39.140 --> 19:40.220
You don't trust me?

19:41.180 --> 19:42.540
I trust what you're saying now,

19:43.220 --> 19:44.660
but I don't trust Lin Zhanqiao.

19:44.660 --> 19:46.740
Fake acting turning real
isn't impossible,

19:46.820 --> 19:47.220
right?

19:47.500 --> 19:47.820
Here.

19:51.300 --> 19:52.580
You've prepared everything?

19:53.260 --> 19:54.780
Take a look at the draft first.

19:55.980 --> 19:57.060
From now on,

19:57.060 --> 20:00.260
your share with me goes from 2:8 to 3:7.

20:01.220 --> 20:02.300
That way,

20:02.300 --> 20:04.260
if you cut me out

20:04.260 --> 20:05.860
and go back to Lin Zhanqiao,

20:06.622 --> 20:09.355
I'll at least have collected
some compensation in advance.

20:21.100 --> 20:22.620
Your information came from Mr. Fan.

20:23.244 --> 20:24.980
So where did his information come from?

20:27.140 --> 20:28.622
Probing something for Lin Zhanqiao?

20:30.380 --> 20:31.060
I don't know.

20:32.900 --> 20:33.980
I really don't know.

20:36.380 --> 20:37.740
Then it must be

20:37.740 --> 20:40.140
someone who has access to her office.

20:48.260 --> 20:48.660
Ms. Lin.

20:52.540 --> 20:53.755
Mantou, Fragile, and Naobaijin

20:53.844 --> 20:55.600
(Potential Author List)
have all asked me

20:55.688 --> 20:57.990
for the list of potential new authors
we intend to work with.

20:58.020 --> 20:58.955
No one else has asked.

20:59.060 --> 20:59.540
Mantou.

21:04.060 --> 21:04.380
Here.

21:05.420 --> 21:06.020
Thanks.

21:07.100 --> 21:07.900
Naobaijin,

21:08.220 --> 21:08.780
your list.

21:11.860 --> 21:13.540
I'm now cycling through

21:13.540 --> 21:14.930
contacting the authors on these lists

21:14.940 --> 21:16.380
to see which ones

21:16.380 --> 21:17.580
Zhao Lanxin has reached out to.

21:18.460 --> 21:20.420
But if one of them

21:20.420 --> 21:21.940
really is the insider,

21:22.780 --> 21:24.460
I'll feel pretty upset.

21:28.620 --> 21:29.100
What's this?

21:29.380 --> 21:31.020
We've finally selected

21:31.020 --> 21:32.260
ten promising authors.

21:32.660 --> 21:33.140
We?

21:35.380 --> 21:36.740
Yes, I

21:36.940 --> 21:37.540
selected them

21:38.355 --> 21:39.377
for the company.

21:41.244 --> 21:42.888
During the previous screening round,

21:43.020 --> 21:44.340
the authors you selected,

21:44.955 --> 21:46.288
along with the sample chapters,

21:46.290 --> 21:47.740
and all your evaluations and comments,

21:47.740 --> 21:48.755
I've reviewed them all.

21:48.820 --> 21:49.900
As a newcomer,

21:50.180 --> 21:51.500
to achieve this level of quality

21:52.020 --> 21:53.180
and efficiency

21:53.190 --> 21:54.020
in such a short time,

21:54.020 --> 21:55.380
handling such a large workload,

21:55.940 --> 21:57.540
if there wasn't someone helping you,

21:57.940 --> 21:59.377
you wouldn't be this organized.

22:06.420 --> 22:07.140
So, who was it?

22:12.580 --> 22:12.980
He Han?

22:17.300 --> 22:19.620
Ms. Lin, I didn't go
to Mr. He Han on my own.

22:19.620 --> 22:21.020
It was him.

22:21.260 --> 22:22.700
He wanted to help us.

22:23.260 --> 22:24.660
And he told me not to mention it.

22:27.200 --> 22:29.370
If he told you not to say anything,
you just kept quiet?

22:29.380 --> 22:31.060
How would he even
know your work details?

22:32.020 --> 22:33.488
You must have told him, right?

22:35.100 --> 22:36.780
Mr. He Han...

22:37.620 --> 22:37.980
Well,

22:38.220 --> 22:38.900
sometimes

22:38.900 --> 22:40.860
I do keep in touch with him.

22:41.140 --> 22:41.940
But I think

22:42.060 --> 22:43.300
he just wanted

22:43.500 --> 22:45.540
to understand Chenxing better.

22:46.111 --> 22:47.620
But anything confidential, I didn't say.

22:47.620 --> 22:49.444
He didn't even ask.
He understands his place.

22:50.100 --> 22:51.020
Do you realize

22:51.620 --> 22:52.780
you've seriously violated

22:52.780 --> 22:55.311
the confidentiality agreement
you signed with the company?

22:56.820 --> 22:57.780
I'm sorry, Ms. Lin, I...

22:57.860 --> 22:58.660
Yes, I know

22:58.660 --> 23:00.100
I should have told you first.

23:00.700 --> 23:02.220
But Mr. He Han knew

23:02.300 --> 23:03.860
that Zhiyuan withdrew funding because

23:03.860 --> 23:05.660
Zhao Lanxin poached
our new author group.

23:06.020 --> 23:07.340
He felt it was unfair for us,

23:07.340 --> 23:09.140
so he helped select new authors.

23:09.380 --> 23:10.780
He's a very principled person.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.911
That's the first time I've heard someone

23:15.140 --> 23:16.740
describe him that way.

23:18.060 --> 23:19.140
From now on,

23:19.140 --> 23:20.580
if you run into any problems at work,

23:20.780 --> 23:21.420
come to me,

23:21.580 --> 23:22.380
not him.

23:22.900 --> 23:23.500
Understood?

23:29.740 --> 23:30.140
Here.

23:31.711 --> 23:33.022
Mooncakes from your idol.

23:48.780 --> 23:49.820
Mr. He, your suit.

23:49.940 --> 23:50.300
Thanks.

23:51.780 --> 23:52.980
A suit? Whose?

23:52.980 --> 23:53.500
Mine.

23:53.900 --> 23:54.540
Yours?

23:55.020 --> 23:56.180
Where did you get a suit?

23:56.180 --> 23:57.977
Don't you avoid wearing
suits unless necessary?

23:58.060 --> 23:59.420
- What for?
- Author Night.

24:00.700 --> 24:01.980
I thought you weren't going?

24:02.100 --> 24:03.380
I think I should still go.

24:03.500 --> 24:04.180
Out of respect.

24:04.180 --> 24:06.100
This suit actually matches your outfit.

24:06.780 --> 24:07.460
I'm not going.

24:08.740 --> 24:09.500
Please go.

24:09.500 --> 24:10.340
Why not?

24:10.340 --> 24:12.140
If you go,
you'll be the center of attention.

24:12.260 --> 24:13.140
Mr. Fan's ex-wife

24:13.140 --> 24:14.600
and He Han's current girlfriend.

24:14.780 --> 24:16.100
I'll leave the spotlight to you.

24:16.580 --> 24:17.980
Mr. Fan is already prepared

24:17.980 --> 24:20.088
to show everyone what kind of sparks

24:20.090 --> 24:23.780
will come from the triangle between you,
He Han, and Gu Yan.

24:25.422 --> 24:27.020
Why do you think
Mr. Fan is so deliberate

24:27.020 --> 24:28.422
about linking Lin Zhanqiao with me?

24:28.511 --> 24:29.780
On one hand, it's business.

24:29.933 --> 24:30.900
But on the other hand,

24:31.140 --> 24:33.260
he wants me to give
you back the "single" label

24:33.660 --> 24:35.060
so he can have a proper reason

24:35.060 --> 24:36.260
to get back together with you.

24:38.860 --> 24:39.733
Give me a break.

24:40.700 --> 24:41.660
An ex-wife for a day

24:41.940 --> 24:42.900
is an ex-wife for life.

25:21.140 --> 25:22.500
That outfit looks pretty sharp.

25:23.140 --> 25:23.500
Yeah.

25:25.244 --> 25:26.377
Heading out, Sir.

25:29.688 --> 25:30.533
You're here.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.844
Showing up in style, huh?

25:33.100 --> 25:34.140
You look great today, too.

25:34.200 --> 25:35.711
I'm just riding on your coattails.

25:35.800 --> 25:37.000
Let's take a photo together.

25:37.010 --> 25:38.020
We'll take one at the venue.

25:38.020 --> 25:39.577
There'll be professional photographers.

25:39.580 --> 25:41.100
I'm worried that since it'll be crowded,

25:41.100 --> 25:42.288
the photos won't turn out well,

25:42.290 --> 25:43.980
or the background
will be full of people,

25:43.980 --> 25:45.130
and we won't get
a proper photo of just us.

25:45.140 --> 25:46.355
Then, let's take one now.

25:48.620 --> 25:48.980
Wait.

25:57.140 --> 25:58.620
Relax, don't be so stiff.

25:58.755 --> 25:59.422
Be natural.

26:01.100 --> 26:01.940
I'm not stiff.

26:01.940 --> 26:03.060
I'm just a bit excited

26:03.140 --> 26:04.755
that we can take a photo like this.

26:04.844 --> 26:06.155
What are you doing?

26:08.340 --> 26:09.180
Alright, let's go.

26:09.340 --> 26:10.020
We'll be late.

26:11.300 --> 26:12.020
Stop staring.

26:12.260 --> 26:13.780
They're off to some high-end event.

26:14.600 --> 26:15.660
That outfit from before

26:15.660 --> 26:16.980
was clearly for tonight.

26:18.780 --> 26:19.740
What kind of event?

26:25.300 --> 26:25.580
Come.

26:25.940 --> 26:26.300
Here.

26:26.780 --> 26:27.300
Take a look.

26:32.711 --> 26:34.244
What's so special about it?

26:41.300 --> 26:42.740
Stop banging like that.

26:42.900 --> 26:44.600
You've already broken several keyboards.

26:44.620 --> 26:46.444
It's not yours,
so you don't care, right?

26:46.660 --> 26:47.220
And last time,

26:47.220 --> 26:48.660
have you paid me back yet?

26:48.711 --> 26:50.933
If you keep this up,
you're not welcome here.

26:56.220 --> 26:57.577
(Dingqi 2024 Annual Author Night)

27:26.300 --> 27:26.820
Hello.

27:27.133 --> 27:29.422
The number you dialed
is currently unavailable.

27:46.111 --> 27:47.311
There is someone here.

27:51.940 --> 27:53.400
I have a company event tonight.

27:53.460 --> 27:55.088
You head back first. We'll talk later.

28:08.620 --> 28:09.400
You'll drive?

28:10.300 --> 28:10.700
I will.

28:13.333 --> 28:14.488
Wipe your mouth clean.

28:16.860 --> 28:18.300
Do you know who that girl is?

28:20.580 --> 28:22.200
She came to the company before,

28:22.200 --> 28:23.700
and applied for a front desk position.

28:23.700 --> 28:24.660
HR turned her down.

28:24.780 --> 28:25.540
The reason was

28:27.511 --> 28:29.066
that she was too good-looking.

28:29.700 --> 28:30.740
She is pretty.

28:30.888 --> 28:32.755
Just right for you to use to provoke me.

28:32.780 --> 28:33.620
A graceful lady

28:33.888 --> 28:35.088
is a gentleman's pursuit.

28:35.380 --> 28:37.140
If you like pretty girls,

28:37.340 --> 28:38.466
then go after them.

28:38.700 --> 28:39.460
But don't think

28:39.460 --> 28:40.980
dating a few girls can provoke me.

28:41.700 --> 28:42.820
I don't care at all.

28:43.140 --> 28:44.740
The one who laughs last laughs best.

28:46.420 --> 28:46.940
Zhao Lanxin,

28:47.620 --> 28:48.580
let me tell you this.

28:49.820 --> 28:50.380
If you weren't

28:50.860 --> 28:52.380
so aggressive all the time,

28:52.380 --> 28:54.844
pushing things your own way,
I might actually consider

28:54.980 --> 28:56.060
being with you.

28:56.222 --> 28:57.340
But the way you are now,

28:57.340 --> 28:59.140
I really can't accept it.

29:02.220 --> 29:03.540
Everything I've done is for you,

29:03.740 --> 29:05.180
for us, and for our future.

29:05.420 --> 29:07.460
All my focus is on you and the company.

29:16.620 --> 29:17.288
Stop the car.

29:17.300 --> 29:17.740
No.

29:18.540 --> 29:19.420
I said stop the car.

29:19.555 --> 29:20.900
If you leave me,
you'll never find someone like me again,

29:20.900 --> 29:22.533
who loves and cares about you this much,

29:22.622 --> 29:24.180
and can go through everything with you.

29:25.488 --> 29:26.466
What are you doing?

29:26.820 --> 29:27.860
To prove how serious I am.

29:28.820 --> 29:29.340
Stop the car.

29:29.860 --> 29:30.420
Stop the car!

29:30.688 --> 29:32.266
What are you doing, Zhao Lanxin?

29:32.620 --> 29:33.780
Alright, I was wrong.

29:33.980 --> 29:34.500
Stop!

29:34.740 --> 29:35.420
Stop, stop!

29:35.820 --> 29:36.500
Stop the car!

29:36.700 --> 29:37.820
Stop the car, Zhao Lanxin!

29:42.088 --> 29:44.222
You don't really have to get out,
do you?

29:54.780 --> 29:56.540
Now you see how much you can't leave me.

30:12.980 --> 30:16.700
(Dingqi Reading)

30:19.580 --> 30:22.180
(Drunk Old Friend, Shattered Six States)

30:22.180 --> 30:24.220
(Drunk Old Friend)

30:24.220 --> 30:25.620
(Shattered Six States)

30:25.620 --> 30:27.180
(Dingqi Annual Author Night)

30:27.180 --> 30:29.260
- Mr. He Han, can I get your autograph?
- Of course, can.

30:29.500 --> 30:30.020
Thank you.

30:30.020 --> 30:30.570
You're welcome.

30:30.580 --> 30:31.620
I love your books.

30:31.620 --> 30:32.020
Thank you.

30:32.260 --> 30:32.860
Thank you all.

30:33.177 --> 30:34.420
- Come.
- This way, please.

30:36.580 --> 30:37.100
Thank you.

30:37.100 --> 30:38.622
Which of my books do you like most?

30:39.260 --> 30:40.700
Once you go in, don't be nervous.

30:44.150 --> 30:46.022
It's your first time,
you'll get used to it.

30:47.460 --> 30:48.500
There are a lot of people.

30:49.580 --> 30:50.020
Hello.

30:51.740 --> 30:52.260
Just arrived?

30:52.740 --> 30:53.340
Mr. He Han.

30:55.860 --> 30:56.220
Handsome.

30:58.180 --> 30:59.580
Been here a while. Waiting for you.

31:01.220 --> 31:02.820
Trying to look all proper,

31:02.820 --> 31:03.780
even wearing a suit now?

31:06.488 --> 31:08.230
Weren't you the one
who always wanted me to?

31:11.540 --> 31:11.980
Ms. Lin,

31:12.140 --> 31:12.980
let's go in first.

31:13.220 --> 31:14.200
Let's go together.

31:20.980 --> 31:21.580
You go ahead.

31:21.740 --> 31:22.711
We'll be right there.

31:25.140 --> 31:25.740
Mr. Gu Yan,

31:25.866 --> 31:27.800
this way please,
I'll take you into the hall.

31:30.660 --> 31:30.860
Come.

31:33.500 --> 31:33.900
Upstairs.

31:36.020 --> 31:36.860
Didn't Dai Shan come?

31:37.333 --> 31:38.444
She said she didn't want to

31:38.466 --> 31:40.555
socialize with Mr. Fan
in this kind of setting.

31:40.600 --> 31:41.460
And if she came,

31:41.620 --> 31:43.466
it wouldn't be
convenient for us to talk.

31:51.700 --> 31:53.100
Mr. Fan is watching us over there.

31:53.660 --> 31:54.820
He's holding a contract.

31:57.940 --> 31:58.700
Your contract?

31:59.380 --> 32:00.060
Probably.

32:00.580 --> 32:01.220
Do well.

32:03.580 --> 32:04.222
Mr. Zhao.

32:05.220 --> 32:05.700
Mr. Fan.

32:06.060 --> 32:07.820
I thought it was two big stars,

32:08.100 --> 32:10.060
turns out it's you,
Mr. He Han and Zhanqiao.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.644
Just a coincidence.

32:13.020 --> 32:13.580
Later,

32:14.220 --> 32:15.300
we should have a good talk.

32:17.380 --> 32:18.580
No rush, you two go ahead.

32:18.900 --> 32:19.844
You two go ahead.

32:20.755 --> 32:21.860
Let's take a photo together.

32:22.020 --> 32:22.460
Sure.

32:22.940 --> 32:23.460
Photographer.

32:24.060 --> 32:24.820
Come here.

32:26.300 --> 32:26.540
Come.

32:27.940 --> 32:28.460
Come.

32:28.733 --> 32:29.844
Alright, look over here.

32:31.444 --> 32:32.220
Okay, that's good.

32:33.022 --> 32:34.688
Make sure you get good shots of them.

32:34.777 --> 32:37.000
It's been a while since you
took photos together, right?

32:37.533 --> 32:38.620
Come, take a few more.

32:38.940 --> 32:39.700
Look here.

32:40.700 --> 32:40.940
Good.

32:41.460 --> 32:42.180
Nice.

32:42.180 --> 32:42.680
Mr. Gu Yan.

32:42.690 --> 32:43.866
Alright, don't blink, one more.

32:47.100 --> 32:47.460
Good.

32:49.260 --> 32:50.580
Don't blink. Another one.

32:55.340 --> 32:55.620
Good.

32:56.380 --> 32:57.020
Look here.

32:58.780 --> 32:59.100
Good.

33:01.380 --> 33:01.860
Good.

33:02.180 --> 33:03.020
Nice, good.

33:04.020 --> 33:04.820
Come, smile.

33:07.540 --> 33:07.820
Good.

33:08.980 --> 33:10.100
A bit closer.

33:10.180 --> 33:10.980
A little closer.

33:11.220 --> 33:12.140
Nice.

33:12.500 --> 33:13.780
You two can move closer.

33:14.340 --> 33:14.580
Good.

33:14.740 --> 33:15.980
Alright, maybe switch a pose.

33:16.260 --> 33:16.540
Good.

33:17.780 --> 33:18.130
Hello.

33:18.130 --> 33:18.660
Nice.

33:18.860 --> 33:19.220
Hello.

33:19.380 --> 33:20.020
Hold that.

33:20.300 --> 33:20.620
Good.

33:21.700 --> 33:21.980
Good.

33:22.044 --> 33:22.700
Stay like that.

33:40.740 --> 33:41.420
Mr. He Han.

33:41.555 --> 33:43.210
- Hello.
- Hello, can I get your autograph?

33:43.220 --> 33:43.980
Of course.

33:44.060 --> 33:44.500
Come.

33:44.660 --> 33:45.377
Here you go.

33:45.980 --> 33:46.460
Here.

33:46.577 --> 33:48.170
Mr. He Han, can I get an autograph?

33:48.170 --> 33:48.780
Sure, sure.

33:49.020 --> 33:50.260
Thank you.

33:50.622 --> 33:51.400
Thank you.

33:51.460 --> 33:52.170
No problem.

33:52.170 --> 33:52.500
Alright.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.180
- Bye.
- Bye.

33:54.180 --> 33:54.540
Goodbye.

34:05.260 --> 34:06.100
Mr. He Han, hello.

34:06.100 --> 34:07.100
We're your fans.

34:07.100 --> 34:08.180
Could we get your autograph?

34:08.180 --> 34:08.900
Of course.

34:09.044 --> 34:10.860
Lin Zhanqiao and He Han came together.

34:11.100 --> 34:12.333
They're back together again?

34:13.088 --> 34:15.066
The two of them are tied together
by shared interests,

34:15.111 --> 34:16.850
even harder to split
than an old married couple.

34:16.860 --> 34:17.660
Mr. He, Ms. Lin,

34:17.860 --> 34:19.420
I really like both of you.

34:19.540 --> 34:20.820
Can we take a photo together?

34:21.780 --> 34:22.580
Of course.

34:22.980 --> 34:23.820
Let's take it here.

34:26.266 --> 34:27.355
You stand in the middle.

34:34.140 --> 34:35.244
Your seat is over here.

34:46.380 --> 34:47.044
Please sit.

34:53.820 --> 34:55.420
(Fan Shu)

34:55.940 --> 34:56.300
Welcome.

34:57.620 --> 34:59.980
(He Han)

35:01.300 --> 35:02.900
(Lin Zhanqiao)

35:02.900 --> 35:03.580
Mr. Gu Yan,

35:04.100 --> 35:05.460
I really love your novels.

35:05.460 --> 35:07.066
Could we add each other on WeChat?

35:07.088 --> 35:07.666
Over here.

35:08.133 --> 35:08.666
Alright.

35:08.740 --> 35:09.300
Thank you.

35:10.460 --> 35:11.266
I'll scan you.

35:12.133 --> 35:13.090
- Please have a seat.
- Sent.

35:13.090 --> 35:13.533
Thank you.

35:13.622 --> 35:14.540
I really enjoy your work.

35:14.540 --> 35:15.820
Looking forward to more.

35:16.340 --> 35:17.044
Thank you.

35:18.911 --> 35:19.980
That over there is Gu Yan.

35:20.100 --> 35:20.820
I'll go say hello.

35:21.220 --> 35:21.700
Sure.

35:23.420 --> 35:24.900
Got his WeChat.

35:27.180 --> 35:27.580
Gu Yan.

35:29.133 --> 35:29.888
I'm Zhao Lanxin.

35:30.100 --> 35:30.980
We've met before.

35:32.060 --> 35:32.540
Hello.

35:33.600 --> 35:35.700
I've been wanting to
find a chance to talk to you,

35:35.900 --> 35:37.620
but Lin Zhanqiao
kept you too well hidden.

35:37.740 --> 35:39.088
I couldn't find the opportunity.

35:39.940 --> 35:40.380
I...

35:40.940 --> 35:42.300
I've signed

35:42.333 --> 35:44.511
a long-term exclusive
contract with Lin Zhanqiao.

35:44.533 --> 35:45.900
I can't have any form of cooperation

35:45.900 --> 35:47.140
with other companies anymore.

35:47.220 --> 35:49.111
That doesn't stop me
from liking your novels.

35:49.420 --> 35:50.260
In my view,

35:50.460 --> 35:51.900
you're more talented than He Han,

35:52.060 --> 35:53.644
and your character is better, too.

35:53.666 --> 35:55.300
If Lin Zhanqiao doesn't elevate you

35:55.300 --> 35:56.260
to his level,

35:56.540 --> 35:57.980
that's unfair to you.

35:59.340 --> 36:00.820
I'm still a newcomer.

36:00.955 --> 36:02.260
I haven't thought that far ahead.

36:02.260 --> 36:03.540
Fame should come early.

36:04.022 --> 36:05.444
If you don't fight for it yourself,

36:05.620 --> 36:06.780
someone like He Han

36:06.940 --> 36:08.180
won't step aside for you.

36:09.200 --> 36:11.022
Come, let's add each other on WeChat.

36:17.180 --> 36:18.260
That's definitely fine.

36:20.866 --> 36:22.288
Mr. Fan, I'll head over first.

36:25.260 --> 36:25.540
Come.

36:27.940 --> 36:28.460
Lanxin.

36:29.300 --> 36:29.820
Mr. Fan.

36:29.900 --> 36:30.900
When did you get here?

36:30.955 --> 36:31.911
I didn't even notice.

36:32.620 --> 36:33.300
You're busy.

36:33.380 --> 36:34.290
But I saw you.

36:34.290 --> 36:35.500
You came in with Lin Zhanqiao.

36:35.780 --> 36:36.500
Come, have a seat.

36:37.660 --> 36:38.222
Alright.

36:43.580 --> 36:45.300
I was worried you might not come.

36:45.300 --> 36:47.280
It's nothing.
Just something at the branch office.

36:49.540 --> 36:50.450
This way, please.

36:50.450 --> 36:51.460
If I remember correctly,

36:51.460 --> 36:52.980
you missed last year's

36:52.980 --> 36:53.980
Author Night, right?

36:54.466 --> 36:55.780
Yes, I was on a business trip.

36:57.500 --> 36:59.140
Look, He Han and Lin Zhanqiao are here.

36:59.380 --> 37:00.700
What a perfect pair.

37:04.977 --> 37:06.860
The data for
Shattered Six States this year

37:06.860 --> 37:07.740
has been impressive.

37:21.380 --> 37:22.660
Why is Gu Yan sitting over there?

37:25.111 --> 37:27.444
Mr. Fan probably wants to
take care of the newcomer.

37:31.420 --> 37:32.620
Dear guests,

37:33.060 --> 37:34.300
respected authors,

37:34.460 --> 37:35.660
ladies and gentlemen,

37:36.140 --> 37:37.900
good evening.

37:40.620 --> 37:42.620
(Welcome to Dingqi Reading Platform)

37:42.820 --> 37:44.740
(2024 Annual Author Night.)

37:45.140 --> 37:46.540
(I am your host, Ji Xinjie.)

37:47.540 --> 37:49.820
(It is a great honor to spend
this evening with all of you,)

37:50.020 --> 37:51.460
(filled with literary charm)

37:51.580 --> 37:53.140
(and sparks of creativity.)

37:53.400 --> 37:54.711
Over the past year,

37:54.860 --> 37:56.500
Dingqi's creative
energy has been thriving.

37:56.860 --> 37:58.980
A new generation of
authors has risen strongly,

37:59.088 --> 38:00.900
with hit works
emerging one after another.

38:01.340 --> 38:02.700
In expanding overseas,

38:03.020 --> 38:05.220
we have moved forward steadily
to new heights.

38:05.311 --> 38:06.940
In intellectual property adaptations,

38:07.100 --> 38:09.488
we have continued to deepen our efforts
and make breakthroughs.

38:09.900 --> 38:12.540
Dingqi has always been committed
to supporting its authors

38:12.780 --> 38:14.820
so that great works
can reach more people

38:14.980 --> 38:16.420
and create greater value.

38:16.940 --> 38:18.820
Next, let us welcome with applause

38:19.060 --> 38:20.940
the Head of Dingqi Content Department,

38:21.180 --> 38:22.900
Mr. Fan Shu, to deliver a speech.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.044
Please welcome him.

38:37.740 --> 38:38.711
(Thank you, everyone.)

38:39.860 --> 38:43.380
(Thank you to all
our outstanding authors.)

38:43.860 --> 38:45.020
Because of your hard work,

38:45.620 --> 38:46.820
over the past year,

38:47.380 --> 38:49.900
Dingqi has achieved remarkable results.

38:50.740 --> 38:52.660
That's why we can have

38:53.220 --> 38:54.820
such a star-filled evening today.

38:55.660 --> 38:56.980
The first major award

38:57.180 --> 38:58.820
we are about to present

38:59.660 --> 39:02.620
is the New Rising Author of the Year.

39:03.500 --> 39:05.060
I'd like to invite a presenter

39:05.940 --> 39:07.060
to reveal

39:07.340 --> 39:08.580
and present this award.

39:09.500 --> 39:10.460
This guest

39:11.380 --> 39:13.700
is widely recognized in the industry

39:14.180 --> 39:15.300
as one of the most talented

39:16.020 --> 39:18.980
and influential authors.

39:19.580 --> 39:20.220
He is also

39:21.020 --> 39:22.740
the brightest star

39:23.780 --> 39:25.020
of tonight's Author Night.

39:26.300 --> 39:27.355
Please welcome He Han.

40:00.222 --> 40:01.140
Thank you, everyone.

40:01.340 --> 40:02.540
Thank you, Dingqi Platform,

40:02.700 --> 40:04.620
and thank you to our dear readers.

40:04.860 --> 40:06.460
Without you, there would be no us.

40:07.340 --> 40:10.660
This is my fourth time
attending Author Night,

40:10.977 --> 40:12.266
and it's a great honor.

40:12.900 --> 40:14.740
The award I'm about to present today

40:14.740 --> 40:17.180
is also very meaningful to me,

40:17.940 --> 40:20.580
because when I received
this award back then,

40:21.020 --> 40:22.820
the person who stood by my side

40:23.140 --> 40:24.260
was my great partner,

40:24.740 --> 40:25.380
Lin Zhanqiao.

40:26.333 --> 40:28.500
Although I'm not here to
receive an award this year,

40:29.140 --> 40:30.300
the person beside me

40:30.740 --> 40:31.460
is still her.

40:36.460 --> 40:38.940
In an ever-changing industry like ours,

40:39.311 --> 40:41.100
the most important thing,
what we need most,

40:41.620 --> 40:43.460
is exactly this kind of

40:43.460 --> 40:45.140
mutual trust and lasting partnership.

40:46.700 --> 40:47.900
On the path of creation,

40:48.060 --> 40:48.860
Lin Zhanqiao and I

40:48.980 --> 40:50.888
could be described
as growing up together.

40:58.700 --> 41:00.900
(The 8th Dingqi
Literary Influence Ranking)

41:00.900 --> 41:03.020
Although recently, we've each begun

41:03.380 --> 41:05.540
new attempts and explorations,

41:06.180 --> 41:07.260
I've always believed

41:07.740 --> 41:08.820
that a temporary parting

41:09.260 --> 41:10.860
is for a better reunion.

41:16.940 --> 41:17.940
Here, I also want to wish

41:17.940 --> 41:19.660
all the young creators

41:20.060 --> 41:21.540
that you can be

41:21.540 --> 41:22.555
as fortunate as I was

41:22.740 --> 41:23.820
to meet an editor

41:24.100 --> 41:26.340
who truly understands you
from the very beginning.

41:27.340 --> 41:29.140
And I hope you learn from me,

41:29.580 --> 41:31.060
learn how to respect

41:31.140 --> 41:32.100
and cherish

41:32.660 --> 41:34.940
the partner who stands
by you and supports you.

41:46.444 --> 41:47.911
Alright, without further ado,

41:48.100 --> 41:50.580
let's reveal this year's

41:51.180 --> 41:52.340
New Rising Author Award.

41:53.380 --> 41:54.422
The winner is

41:55.700 --> 41:56.300
Gu Yan.

42:06.620 --> 42:07.420
He's not here?

42:07.500 --> 42:08.540
Please understand.

42:09.140 --> 42:10.580
The young man might be a bit nervous,

42:10.580 --> 42:12.260
so he stepped out to gather himself.

42:13.460 --> 42:15.260
I'll accept it on his behalf.

42:15.933 --> 42:16.770
Thank you, everyone.

42:16.780 --> 42:17.500
(Gu Yan)

42:17.500 --> 42:18.940
(Drunk Old Friend)

42:50.100 --> 42:50.580
Zhanqiao,

42:51.980 --> 42:52.460
let's talk.

42:56.180 --> 42:56.620
Let's talk?

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
